		<tr>
			<td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:3%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">1.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:30%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Qoraqalpog‘iston Respublikasi, viloyatlar va Toshkent shahri, tuman (shahar) tashkilotlarining 14 mingta rahbarlari va ularning o‘rinbosarlarining har biriga 5 tadan eng og‘ir ahvoldagi kambag‘al oilalarni biriktirish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:none; width:37%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">1. Tuman (shahar), mahalla kesimida rahbarlar va ularning o‘rinbosarlari biriktiriladigan kambag‘al oilalar ro‘yxatini shakllantirish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:none; width:12%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">2024-yil 1-oktabr</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:16%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Qoraqalpog‘iston Respublikasi Vazirlar Kengashi, viloyatlar va Toshkent shahri hokimliklari</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="border-bottom:none; width:37%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">2. Kambag‘al oilalarning kambag‘allikka tushish sabablaridan kelib chiqib, rahbarlar va ularning o‘rinbosarlarini 5 tadan oilaga biriktirish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:none; width:12%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Bir hafta muddatda</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:37%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">3. Mazkur rahbarlarga 6 oydan so‘ng yana 5 tadan oilani biriktirish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:12%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Har 6 oyda</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:3%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">2.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:30%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Eng og‘ir ahvoldagi mahallalarga respublika darajasidagi davlat idoralari rahbarlari va ularning o‘rinbosarlarini biriktirish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:none; width:37%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">1. Kam ta’minlangan oilalarning ulushi yuqori, ijtimoiy-iqtisodiy rivojlanishi hamda infratuzilma bilan ta’minlanish darajasi past bo‘lgan eng og‘ir ahvoldagi 1000 ta mahallalar ro‘yxatini shakllantirish va tasdiqlash.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:none; width:12%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">2024-yil 5-oktabr</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:16%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Vazirlar Mahkamasi,</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Kambag‘allikni qisqartirish va bandlik vazirligi,</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Iqtisodiyot va moliya vazirligi</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">(A. Xaydarov),</span></span></i></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Ijtimoiy himoya milliy agentligi</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">(S. Abdullayev)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:37%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">2. Eng og‘ir ahvoldagi mahallalarga biriktiriladigan respublika darajasidagi rahbarlar va ularning o‘rinbosarlar ro‘yxatini shakllantirish va ularga mahallalarni biriktirish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:12%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Bir hafta muddatda</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:3%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">3.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:30%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Kambag‘allikdan chiqqan oilalarning ijobiy tajribasini ommalashtirish, ularning ijtimoiylashuviga, bandligiga, shuningdek, moliyaviy mustaqilligiga ko‘maklashishga o‘z hissasini qo‘shgan tadbirkorlik subyektlarini rag‘batlantirish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:none; width:37%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">1. Kambag‘al oilalarning ijtimoiylashuviga, bandligiga, shuningdek, moliyaviy mustaqilligiga ko‘maklashishga o‘z hissasini qo‘shib kelayotgan tadbirkorlik subyektlarini davlat va boshqa mukofotlar bilan taqdirlash, ular orasida “Inson uchun” ko‘rik-tanlovini o‘tkazish tartibini tasdiqlash.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:none; width:12%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Bir oy muddatda</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:16%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Savdo-sanoat palatasi</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">(D. Vahobov)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Ijtimoiy himoya milliy agentligi</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">(S. Abdullayev),</span></span></i></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">O‘zbekiston mahallalari uyushmasi</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">(K. Kuranbayev)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Madaniyat vazirligi</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">(O. Nazarbekov)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">O‘zbekiston Milliy axborot agentligi</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">(<i>A. Ko‘chimov)</i>,</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">O‘zbekiston Milliy teleradio-kompaniyasi</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">(A. Jo‘raboyev)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="border-bottom:none; width:37%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">2. Kambag‘allikdan chiqqan oilalarning ijobiy tajribasini ommalashtirish, ular to‘g‘risida filmlar ishlab chiqish, davriy nashrlar va boshqa matbaa mahsulotlarini chop etish, ko‘rsatuvlar, radioeshittirishlarni tashkil etish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:none; width:12%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Doimiy</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:37%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">3. Davlat buyurtmasi bo‘yicha yaratiladigan kinofilmlarda kambag‘al oilani mehnat orqali kambag‘allikdan chiqarish, ularga davlat tomonidan taqdim etilayotgan ijtimoiy yordam va imtiyozlarni aks ettirish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:12%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Doimiy</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:3%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">4.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:30%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">“Kambag‘allikdan farovonlik sari”</span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"> dasturida nazarda tutilgan imkoniyatlarni ro‘yobga chiqarish yuzasidan barcha darajadagi idoralar va tashkilotlarning, shuningdek, kambag‘al oilalarga va mahallalarga biriktirilgan rahbarlar faoliyatining samaradorlik ko‘rsatkichlarini belgilash.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:37%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">1. “Kambag‘allikdan farovonlik sari” dasturida belgilangan vazifalardan kelib chiqqan holda indikatorlarni ishlab chiqish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">2. Ushbu indikatorlar asosida mahallalarga va kambag‘al oilalarga biriktirilgan rahbarlar faoliyatining samaradorlik ko‘rsatkichlarini ishlab chiqib tasdiqlash uchun “Kambag‘allikdan farovonlik sari” dasturini amalga oshirish bo‘yicha respublika komissiyasiga kiritish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:12%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Bir oy muddatda</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:16%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Kambag‘allikni qisqartirish va bandlik vazirligi<i>,</i></span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Ijtimoiy himoya milliy agentligi</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">(S. Abdullayev)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:100%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">II. Barqaror bandlik va yuqori daromad topishga erishish, tadbirkorlar bilan o‘zaro manfaatli hamkorlik o‘rnatish, “drayver” loyihalarni amalga oshirish, yer maydonlarini kambag‘al oilalarga ijaraga berish, tadbirkorlikka jalb qilish</span></span></b></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:3%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">5.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:30%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">2024-yil yakuniga qadar 500 ming, 2025-yil davomida 1 million nafar aholini kambag‘allikdan chiqarish choralarini ko‘rish yuzasidan kompleks chora-tadbirlarni amalga oshirish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:37%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">1. 2024-2025-yillarga mo‘ljallangan maqsadli ko‘rsatkichlarni “viloyat — tuman (shahar) — mahalla” darajasida belgilash.</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">2. Mavjud iqtisodiy instrumentlar asosida aholi bandligini ta’minlash, yoshlarning ta’lim olishi va kasb-hunar o‘rganishi, aholining tibbiy va ijtimoiy xizmatlardan foydalanishi hamda mahallalar infratuzilmasini rivojlantirish choralarini ko‘rish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">3. Amalga oshirilgan ishlar yuzasidan choraklik ma’lumotlarni Prezident Administratsiyasiga kiritib borish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:12%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">2024-2025-yillar davomida</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:16%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Kambag‘allikni qisqartirish va bandlik vazirligi<i>,</i></span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Iqtisodiyot va moliya vazirligi</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">(I. Norqulov),</span></span></i></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Ijtimoiy himoya milliy agentligi</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">(J. Abruyev),</span></span></i></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Qoraqalpog‘iston Respublikasi Vazirlar Kengashi, viloyatlar va Toshkent shahri hokimliklari</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:3%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">6.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:30%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Kambag‘al oilalarga ko‘mak choralarini ijtimoiy shartnoma asosida ko‘rsatish tartibini joriy etish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:37%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">1. Ijtimoiy shartnoma tizimini joriy qilish bo‘yicha xalqaro tajribani o‘rganish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">2. Davlat tomonidan aholini ijtimoiy qo‘llab-quvvatlash hamda ularning daromadini oshirishga qaratilgan xarajatlarni tahlil qilish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">3. Ijtimoiy shartnomani amaliyotga joriy etish tartibini tasdiqlash uchun “Kambag‘allikdan farovonlik sari” dasturini amalga oshirish bo‘yicha respublika komissiyasiga kiritish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">4. Oilaning mehnatga layoqatli a’zolaridan bandlikni talab qilgan holda ko‘rsatiladigan ijtimoiy xizmatlar va yordamlar ro‘yxatini tasdiqlash uchun Vazirlar Mahkamasiga kiritish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:12%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">2024-yil 1-noyabr</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:16%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Ijtimoiy himoya milliy agentligi</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">(J. Abruyev),</span></span></i></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Kambag‘allikni qisqartirish va bandlik vazirligi<i>,</i></span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Iqtisodiyot va moliya vazirligi</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">(O. Fozilkarimov)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:3%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">7.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:30%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">2024-2025-yillarda 100 mingta kambag‘al oilaga paxta-g‘alla maydonlarini qisqartirish hisobiga “kompaniya — kooperativ — dehqon xo‘jaligi” tamoyili asosida dehqonchilik va bog‘dorchilik tashkil etish uchun 50 ming gektar yer maydonlarini 30 yilgacha ijaraga berish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:none; width:37%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="tab-stops:0cm 2.0cm"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">1. Quyidagilarni nazarda tutuvchi Vazirlar Mahkamasining qarori loyihasini ishlab chiqish:</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:none; width:12%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">2024-yil 1-noyabr</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:16%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Vazirlar Mahkamasi,</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Qishloq xo‘jaligi vazirligi,</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">tegishli vazirlik va idoralar</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:37%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="tab-stops:0cm 2.0cm"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">2024-2025-yillarda tuman hokimliklari zaxirasidagi 50 ming gektar yer maydonlarini elektron onlayn auksion savdolariga qo‘yish;</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="tab-stops:0cm 2.0cm"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">yer maydonlarini ijaraga berish bo‘yicha elektron onlayn auksion savdolarini “mahalla yettiligi”ning tavsiyasi bilan kambag‘al oilalar o‘rtasida o‘tkazish;</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="tab-stops:0cm 2.0cm"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">yer maydonlarini ijaraga berish bo‘yicha elektron onlayn auksion savdolari g‘oliblariga yer uchastkasi narxini 10 yil muddatga teng ulushlarda foizsiz bo‘lib-bo‘lib to‘lashga ruxsat etish;</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="tab-stops:0cm 2.0cm"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">garov pulini bazaviy hisoblash miqdorining 10 foizi miqdorida belgilash.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:12%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">2024-2025-yillar davomida</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:3%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">8.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:30%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Aholining ijtimoiy ehtiyojmand toifalarini ishga joylashtirish uchun tashkilot (ish beruvchi) tomonidan zaxiralangan ish o‘rinlari to‘g‘risida ma’lumotlar (ish.mehnat.uz) real vaqt rejimida yangilab boriladigan platformani ishga tushirish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Bunda, hokim yordamchisi tomonidan zaxiralangan ish o‘rinlariga kambag‘al oila a’zolarini to‘g‘ridan-to‘g‘ri ish beruvchiga yuborish tizimini joriy etish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:37%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="tab-stops:0cm 2.0cm"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Quyidagilarni nazarda tutuvchi qaror loyihasini Vazirlar Mahkamasiga kiritish:</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="tab-stops:0cm 2.0cm"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">1. Tashkilot (ish beruvchi) tomonidan zaxiralangan ish o‘rinlari to‘g‘risida ma’lumotlar real vaqt rejimida yangilab boriladigan platformani ishga tushirish;</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="tab-stops:0cm 2.0cm"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">2. Ish beruvchilar o‘rtasida o‘zlarida mavjud kvotalangan ish o‘rinlarini platformaga kiritish, kambag‘al oilalar a’zolariga kvotalangan ish o‘rinlarini taklif etish bo‘yicha targ‘ibot tadbirlarini tashkil etish;</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">3. Hokim yordamchisi tomonidan zaxiralangan ish o‘rinlariga kambag‘al oila a’zolarini to‘g‘ridan-to‘g‘ri ish beruvchiga yuborish tizimini joriy etish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:12%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">2025-yil iyul</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:16%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Kambag‘allikni qisqartirish va bandlik vazirligi,</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Ijtimoiy himoya milliy agentligi</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">(S. Abdullayev),</span></span></i></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Adliya vazirligi</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">(A. Tashkulov)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:3%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">9.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:30%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><a id="_Hlk176029642"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Mehnatga haq to‘lashning eng kam miqdorining 1,5 baravaridan kam bo‘lmagan oylik ish haqi to‘langan holda ishga qabul qilingan </span></span></a><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">kambag‘al oila a’zosi uchun ijtimoiy soliqni uch yil davomida 1 foiz stavkada belgilash.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:37%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">1. Mehnatga haq to‘lashning eng kam miqdorining 1,5 baravaridan kam bo‘lmagan oylik ish haqi to‘langan holda ishga qabul qilingan kambag‘al oila a’zosi uchun ijtimoiy soliq uch yil davomida 1 foiz stavkada to‘lash bo‘yicha hujjat loyihasini ishlab chiqish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">2. Qonun loyihasini Vazirlar Mahkamasiga kiritish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:12%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">2025-yil 1-yanvar</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:16%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Iqtisodiyot va moliya vazirligi</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">(A. Xaydarov),</span></span></i></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Davlat soliq qo‘mitasi</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">(Sh. Kudbiyev)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Ijtimoiy himoya milliy agentligi</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">(J. Abruyev),</span></span></i></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Kambag‘allikni qisqartirish va bandlik vazirligi</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:100%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">III. Ta’lim olish va kasb-hunarga o‘rganish imkoniyatini yaratish, maktabgacha ta’lim bilan qamrovni oshirish, xorijiy tillarga, kasb-hunarga yoki mutaxassislikka o‘qitish, oliy ma’lumot olishga ko‘maklashish</span></span></b></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td rowspan="4" style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:3%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">10.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td rowspan="4" style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:30%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Kambag‘al oilalarning farzandlarini maktabdan tashqari ta’lim va sport to‘garaklariga qamrab olish darajasini oshirish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:none; width:37%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">1. Respublika bo‘yicha har bir umumta’lim maktabida mavjud bo‘sh bino-inshoot va yer maydonlarini xatlovdan o‘tkazish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:none; width:12%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">2024-yil 1-noyabr</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td rowspan="4" style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:16%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Maktabgacha va maktab ta’limi vazirligi</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">(X. Umarova),</span></span></i></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Sport vazirligi</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">(A. Ikramov),</span></span></i></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Ijtimoiy himoya milliy agentligi</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">(S. Abdullayev),</span></span></i></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Iqtisodiyot va moliya vazirligi</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">(O. Fozilkarimov),</span></span></i></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Adliya vazirligi</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">(A. Tashkulov)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="border-bottom:none; width:37%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">2. Xatlov natijalaridan kelib chiqib, umumta’lim maktablarining bo‘sh turgan yer va bino-inshootlarida xorijiy tillar, kasbga o‘qitish va axborot texnologiyalari va dasturlashtirish bo‘yicha o‘quv kurslarini tashkil etish yuzasidan dasturni Vazirlar Mahkamasiga kiritish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:none; width:12%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Ikki oy muddatda</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="border-bottom:none; width:37%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">3. Har bir umumta’lim maktabida, “Barkamol avlod” maktablarida, shu jumladan xususiy sektorni jalb qilgan holda maktabdan tashqari ta’lim va sport to‘garaklarini tashkil etish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:none; width:12%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">2024-yil 31-dekabr</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:37%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">4. Xususiy maktabgacha ta’lim tashkilotlari tashkil etilishini moliyaviy rag‘batlantirish bo‘yicha takliflarni Vazirlar Mahkamasiga kiritish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:12%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Ikki oy muddatda</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:3%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">11.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:30%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">2025-yil yakuniga qadar respublikadagi 3 — 7 yoshli bolalarning maktabgacha ta’lim bilan qamrov darajasini 80 foizga yetkazish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:none; width:37%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="tab-stops:0cm 2.0cm"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">1. Mahallalar kesimida 3 — 7 yoshli bolalarning maktabgacha ta’lim bilan qamrovi darajasini o‘rganib chiqish.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:none; width:12%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">2024-yil 1-oktabr</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:none; width:16%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Maktabgacha va maktab ta’lim vazirligi</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">(X. Umarova)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Iqtisodiyot va moliya vazirligi</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">(O. Fozilkarimov)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Qoraqalpog‘iston Respublikasi Vazirlar Kengashi, viloyatlar va Toshkent shahri hokimliklari</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="border-bottom:none; width:37%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="tab-stops:0cm 2.0cm"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">2. 2025-yil yakuniga qadar 3 — 7 yoshli bolalarni maktabgacha ta’lim bilan qamrab olish dasturini ishlab chiqish va bunda quyidagilarni nazarda tutish:</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="tab-stops:0cm 2.0cm"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">aholining yashash darajasi va to‘lov qobiliyati yuqori bo‘lgan (kambag‘al oilalar kam bo‘lgan) mahallalarda davlat-xususiy sheriklik shaklidagi nodavlat maktabgacha ta’lim tashkilotlarini tashkil etish;</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="tab-stops:0cm 2.0cm"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">oilaviy nodavlat maktabgacha ta’lim tashkilotlarini faqatgina olis va chekka mahallalarda tashkil etish;</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="tab-stops:0cm 2.0cm"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">aholining to‘lov qobiliyati past (kambag‘al oilalar nisbatan ko‘p bo‘lgan) va demografik o‘sish darajasi yuqori bo‘lgan mahallalarda davlat, shu jumladan, xalqaro moliya institutlari kredit va grant mablag‘lari hisobidan davlat-xususiy sheriklik shaklidagi nodavlat maktabgacha ta’lim tashkilotlarini tashkil etish;</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="tab-stops:0cm 2.0cm"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">ijtimoiy soha muassasalarining bo‘sh binolarida qisqa muddatli guruhlarni tashkil etish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:none; width:12%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">2024-yil 1-noyabr</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:37%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="tab-stops:0cm 2.0cm"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">3. 2025-2026-yillarda maktabgacha ta’lim bilan qamrov darajasini oshirishni nazarda tutuvchi Vazirlar Mahkamasi qarori loyihasini tasdiqlash uchun kiritish.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:12%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">2024-yil 15-noyabr</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:16%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Maktabgacha va maktab ta’lim vazirligi</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">(X. Umarova)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:3%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">12.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:30%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Davlat-xususiy sheriklik shaklidagi nodavlat maktabgacha ta’lim tashkilotlari tashkil etilishni rag‘batlantirish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:37%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="tab-stops:0cm 2.0cm"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">1. Davlat-xususiy sheriklik shaklidagi nodavlat maktabgacha ta’lim tashkilotlarini (oilaviy maktabgacha ta’lim tashkilotlari bundan mustasno) tashkil etish va faoliyatini kengaytirish istagida bo‘lgan tadbirkorlarni moliyaviy rag‘batlantirishning (past foizli kredit ajratish) yangi mexanizmini ishlab chiqish.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="tab-stops:0cm 2.0cm"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">2. Rag‘batlantirishning yangi mexanizmi bo‘yicha takliflarni Vazirlar Mahkamasiga kiritish.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:12%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">2024-yil 1-dekabr</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:16%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Iqtisodiyot va moliya vazirligi</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">(O. Fozilkarimov),</span></span></i></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Maktabgacha va maktab ta’lim vazirligi</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">(X. Umarova)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:3%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">13.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:30%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Kambag‘al oilalar reyestriga kiritilgan oilalar farzandlarining davlat oliy ta’lim muassasalari talabalar turar joylaridagi yashash xarajatlarini qoplab berish tartibini tasdiqlash.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:none; width:37%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">1. Kambag‘al oilalar reyestriga kiritilgan oilalar farzandlarining yashash xarajatlarini qoplab berish tartibini tasdiqlash bo‘yicha Vazirlar Mahkamasi qarori loyihasini ishlab chiqish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:none; width:12%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">2025-yil 1-iyun</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:16%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Oliy ta’lim, fan va innovatsiyalar vazirligi</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">(K. Sharipov),</span></span></i></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Iqtisodiyot va moliya vazirligi</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">(O. Fozilkarimov)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="border-bottom:none; width:37%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">2. Manfaatdor vazirlik va idoralar bilan qaror loyihasini kelishish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:none; width:12%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">2025-yil 15-iyun</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:37%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">3. Qaror loyihasini o‘rnatilgan tartibda Vazirlar Mahkamasiga kiritish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:12%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">2025-yil 20-iyun</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:3%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">14.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:30%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">“El-yurt umidi” jamg‘armasi tomonidan Kambag‘al oilalar reyestriga kiritilgan oilalar farzandlari uchun alohida grantlar ajratish choralarini ko‘rish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:37%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">1. Jamg‘armaning har yilgi kvotalarini ishlab chiqishda Kambag‘al oilalar reyestriga kiritilgan oilalar farzandlari uchun alohida grantlar ajratish bo‘yicha parametrlarni shakllantirish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">2. Jamg‘arma Vasiylik kengashi tomonidan Kambag‘al oilalar reyestriga kiritilgan oilalar farzandlari uchun alohida grantlarni tasdiqlash hamda talabgorlarni saralab olish choralarini ko‘rish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:12%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Har yili</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Jamg‘arma stipendiyalarini e’lon qilish muddatidan kelib chiqib</span></span></i></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:16%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Vazirlar Mahkamasi,</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">“El-yurt umidi” jamg‘armasi</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">(Bekmurodov)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Oliy ta’lim, fan va innovatsiyalar vazirligi</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">(K. Sharipov)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:3%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">15.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:30%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Oliy ta’lim muassasalariga davlat granti bo‘yicha qabul kvotasini bosqichma-bosqich oshirib borish orqali Kambag‘al oilalar reyestriga kiritilgan oilalar farzandlari ta’lim olishlari uchun imkoniyatni kengaytirish choralarini ko‘rish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:37%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Kambag‘al oilalar reyestriga</span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"> kiritilgan oilalar farzandlari ta’lim olishlari uchun imkoniyatni kengaytirish tartibini belgilovchi qaror loyihasini ishlab chiqish, bunda:</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">a) 2024/2025 o‘quv yilidan boshlab oliy ta’lim muassasalarida o‘zlashtirish ko‘rsatkichi:</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">80 foizidan yuqori bo‘lgan talabalarga keyingi o‘quv yili uchun davlat grantini taqdim etish;</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">70 foizidan yuqori bo‘lgan talabalarga keyingi o‘quv yili uchun foizsiz ta’lim krediti ajratish;</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">b) 2025/2026 o‘quv yilidan boshlab davlat grantiga qabul qilish uchun zarur bo‘lgan ballning 90 foizini to‘plagan talabalarga davlat grantini berish. Bunda tegishli yo‘nalish bo‘yicha ajratilgan davlat granti kvotasining 10 foizgacha bo‘lgan qismi Kambag‘al oilalar reyestriga kiritilgan oilalar farzandlari uchun yo‘naltirish;</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">v) moliyaviy mustaqil bo‘lgan davlat oliy ta’lim muassasalari rektorlari bilan birgalikda oliy ta’lim muassasalarining budjetdan tashqari mablag‘lari hisobidan har yili kamida 1 mlrd so‘mgacha miqdoridagi ta’lim grantlari ajratish amaliyotini joriy etishni ko‘zda tutish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:12%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">2024-yil 1-noyabr</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:16%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Vazirlar Mahkamasi,</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Oliy ta’lim, fan va innovatsiyalar vazirligi</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">(K. Sharipov),</span></span></i></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Iqtisodiyot va moliya vazirligi</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">(O. Fozilkarimov)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:100%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">IV. Kambag‘al oilalar a’zolarining kafolatlangan davlat tibbiy xizmatidan foydalanishi, tibbiy ko‘rikdan o‘tishi hamda o‘z sog‘lig‘i uchun ijtimoiy mas’uliyatini oshirishiga ko‘maklashish</span></span></b></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:3%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">16.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:30%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Kambag‘al oilalarni tibbiy ko‘rikdan o‘tkazish, ularning o‘z sog‘lig‘i uchun ijtimoiy mas’uliyatini oshirish choralarini ko‘rish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:37%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">1. Kambag‘al oilalarning har bir a’zosini yilda bir marta to‘liq tibbiy ko‘rikdan o‘tkazish grafigini ishlab chiqish va tibbiy ko‘rikdan o‘tkazish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">2. Kambag‘al oilalarning o‘z sog‘lig‘i uchun ijtimoiy mas’uliyatini oshirish (kundalik turmush tarzi va iste’molda zararli odatlardan voz kechish) bo‘yicha targ‘ibot va tashviqot ishlarini amalga oshirish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">3. Kambag‘al oilalar farzandlarining har biri sport to‘garaklariga qatnashishi uchun imkoniyatlar yaratish, oilaning tibbiy xizmatlarga o‘z hisobidan sarflaydigan xarajatlarini qisqartirish choralarini ko‘rish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:12%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Doimiy</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:16%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Sog‘liqni saqlash vazirligi</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">(A. Xudayarov)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Sport vazirligi</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">(A. Ikramov),</span></span></i></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Ijtimoiy himoya milliy agentligi</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">(S. Abdullayev),</span></span></i></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Kambag‘al oilalarga biriktirilgan rahbarlar va ularning o‘rinbosarlari</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:3%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">17.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:30%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Davlat va nodavlat tibbiyot tashkilotlarida davlat budjeti mablag‘lari hisobidan tibbiy yordam ko‘rsatish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:none; width:37%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="tab-stops:23.1pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">1. Vazirlar Mahkamasining qaror loyihasini ishlab chiqish.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:none; width:12%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">2024-yil 1-noyabr</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:16%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Sog‘liqni saqlash vazirligi</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">(A. Xudayarov)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Iqtisodiyot va moliya vazirligi</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">(O. Fozilkarimov)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="border-bottom:none; width:37%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="tab-stops:23.1pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">2. Manfaatdor vazirlik va idoralar bilan qaror loyihasi kelishish.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:none; width:12%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">2024-yil 15-noyabr</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:37%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="tab-stops:23.1pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">3. Hujjat loyihasini Vazirlar Mahkamasiga kiritish.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:12%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">2024-yil 30-noyabr</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:3%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">18.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:30%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Oilaning davlat tomonidan taqdim etiladigan tibbiy xizmatlardan to‘liq foydalanishi, xususan, ayollar va bolalarning tizimli ravishda skriningdan o‘tkazilishini ta’minlash, xonadonda sanitariya holatini yaxshilash, oila a’zolarini zararli odatlardan voz kechishga, yoshidan qat’iy nazar har bir oila a’zosining jismoniy tarbiya va sport bilan shug‘ullanishiga erishish, qariyalarni piyoda yurishga o‘rgatish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:none; width:37%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">1. Aholini profilaktik tibbiy ko‘riklardan o‘tkazish grafigini ishlab chiqish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:none; width:12%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">2024-yil 1-noyabr</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:16%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Qoraqalpog‘iston Respublikasi, viloyatlar va Toshkent shahri, tuman (shahar) tashkilotlarining kambag‘al oilalarga biriktirilgan rahbar xodimlari</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:37%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
