			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">3. Sog‘lom turmush tarzini targ‘ibot va tashviqot qilish ishlarini amalga oshirish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:12%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Doimiy</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:100%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">V. Ijtimoiy xizmatdan foydalanish imkoniyatini ro‘yobga chiqarish choralarini amalga oshirish</span></span></b></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:3%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">19.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:30%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Kambag‘al oilalar reyestrini shakllantirish hamda oilalarni kambag‘allikdan chiqarish bo‘yicha individual reja ishlab chiqish tartibini belgilash.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:none; width:37%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">1. Oilalarni Kambag‘al oilalar reyestriga kiritish va chiqarish mezonlarini ishlab chiqish va tasdiqlash uchun “Kambag‘allikdan farovonlik sari” dasturini amalga oshirish bo‘yicha respublika komissiyasiga kiritish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:none; width:12%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
