			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">3. Qaror loyihasini Vazirlar Mahkamasiga kiritish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
