			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:30%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><a id="_Hlk177307127"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Kambag‘al oilalar reyestriga kiritilgan boquvchisini yo‘qotgan to‘liq bo‘lmagan oilalar, mehnatga layoqatli shaxs bo‘lmagan oilalar, ikki va undan ortiq nogironligi bo‘lgan shaxs mavjud oilalardagi o‘zgalar parvarishiga muhtoj shaxslarga kunduzgi qatnov asosida qarab turish xizmatini yo‘lga qo‘yish</span></span></a><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:37%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">O‘zgalar parvarishiga muhtoj shaxslarga kunduzgi qatnov asosida qarab turish xizmatini Samarqand va Toshkent shahrida eksperiment tariqasida autsorsing asosida amalga oshirish tartibini ishlab chiqish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Bunda Kambag‘al oilalar reyestriga kiritilgan boquvchisini yo‘qotgan to‘liq bo‘lmagan oilalar, mehnatga layoqatli shaxs bo‘lmagan oilalar, ikki va undan ortiq nogironligi bo‘lgan shaxs mavjud oilalardagi o‘zgalar parvarishiga muhtoj shaxslarga kunduzgi qatnov asosida qarab turish xizmatlari amalga oshirilishini nazarda tutish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:12%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">2024-yil 1-noyabr</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:16%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Ijtimoiy himoya milliy agentligi</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">(M. Tashxodjayev),</span></span></i></span></span></span></p>

