			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:3%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">22.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:30%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Ijtimoiy yetimlikning oldini olish, yetim va ota-ona qaramog‘idan mahrum bo‘lgan bolalarga individual yondashuv asosida xizmat ko‘rsatish uchun mahallalarda oila shaklidagi kichik hajmli ? bolalar uylari tashkil etish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:none; width:37%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">1. Toshkent shahrida eksperiment tariqasida mahallalarda oila shaklidagi kichik hajmli bolalar uylarini tashkil etish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:none; width:12%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">2024-yil 31-dekabr</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:16%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Ijtimoiy himoya milliy agentligi</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">(S. Abdullayev)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:37%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">2. Eksperiment natijalaridan kelib chiqib, mahallalarda oila shaklidagi kichik hajmli bolalar uylarini tashkil etish tartibini ishlab chiqib, tasdiqlash uchun Vazirlar Mahkamasiga kiritish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:12%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">2025-yil 31-mart</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:100%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">VI. Mahalla infratuzilmasini rivojlantirish, mahallani elektr energiyasi bilan uzluksiz ta’minlash, uning tuman markazi bilan transport jihatidan bog‘langanligini yaxshilash, ichki yo‘llarni ta’mirlash va tomorqalarni sug‘orish suvi bilan ta’minlash imkoniyatini yaxshilash, hududlarni jadal kompleks rivojlantirish</span></span></b></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:3%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">23.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:30%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Eng og‘ir ahvoldagi mahallalarning infratuzilmasini yaxshilash dasturini amalga oshirish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:none; width:37%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">1. Vazirlar Mahkamasi tomonidan tasdiqlangan ro‘yxat bo‘yicha eng og‘ir ahvoldagi 1000 ta mahallaning infratuzilmasi holatini (elektr energiyasi, suv, gaz, sug‘orish tizimi, internet, ichki yo‘llar va boshqa) o‘rganish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:none; width:12%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">2024-yil 15-oktabr</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:16%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Kambag‘allikni qisqartirish va bandlik vazirligi,</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Iqtisodiyot va moliya vazirligi</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">(A. Xaydarov),</span></span></i></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">O‘zbekiston mahallalari uyushmasi</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">(K. Kuranbayev)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Mahallalarga biriktirilgan respublika darajasidagi davlat idoralarining rahbar xodimlari</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="border-bottom:none; width:37%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">2. Mahallalarda tomorqa yerlarini sug‘orishni yaxshilash yoki ularga elektr energiyasi barqaror yetkazib berilishini ta’minlash, internet sifatini yaxshilash, ichki yo‘llarni ta’mirlash va boshqa infratuzilmani yaxshilash dasturini Vazirlar Mahkamasiga kiritish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:none; width:12%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">2024-yil 20-oktabr</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:37%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">3. Mahallalarda tomorqa yerlarini sug‘orishni yaxshilash yoki ularga elektr energiyasi barqaror yetkazib berilishini ta’minlash, internet sifatini yaxshilash, ichki yo‘llarni ta’mirlash va boshqa infratuzilmani yaxshilash dasturi uchun 3,2 trillion so‘m mablag‘ ajratish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:12%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">2024-2025-yillar</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:3%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">24.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:30%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Tuman va shaharlarning ixtisoslashuvidan kelib chiqib, sanoat, qishloq xo‘jaligi hamda xizmat ko‘rsatish sohalarida tadbirkorlikni rivojlantirish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:none; width:37%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Har bir tuman uchun sanoat, qishloq xo‘jaligi hamda xizmat ko‘rsatish sohalarida tadbirkorlikni rivojlantirishga turtki beruvchi 5 tadan “drayver” loyihalar ro‘yxatini tasdiqlash.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:none; width:12%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">O‘n kun muddatda</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:16%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Vazirlar Mahkamasi, Iqtisodiyot va moliya vazirligi</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">(A. Xaydarov),</span></span></i></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">tegishli vazirlik va idoralar</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:37%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Mazkur loyihalarning zarur infratuzilmasini yaratish uchun Davlat budjetidan 1 trillion so‘m mablag‘lar ajratish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:12%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">2024-2025-yillar</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:3%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">25.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:30%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">2024-2025-yillarda </span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">jadal kompleks rivojlantirish uchun tanlab olingan 15 ta tuman va shaharni kompleks rivojlantirish dasturlarini tasdiqlash choralarini ko‘rish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:none; width:37%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">1. 2024-2025-yillarda </span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">jadal kompleks rivojlantirish uchun tanlab olingan 15 ta tuman va shaharni kompleks rivojlantirish dasturini ishlab chiqish va tasdiqlash.</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Bunda kamida bittadan mahallada “yashil mahalla” loyihalarini amalga oshirish nazarda tutiladi.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:none; width:12%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">2024-yil 1-dekabr</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:16%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Vazirlar Mahkamasi,</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Iqtisodiyot va moliya vazirligi</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">(A. Xaydarov),</span></span></i></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">tegishli vazirlik va idoralar</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:37%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">2. Tasdiqlangan dastur doirasida belgilangan vazifalarni amalga oshirish va yuzaga kelayotgan muammolarni o‘rganish va bartaraf etish bo‘yicha choralar ko‘rish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:12%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Dasturda nazarda tutilgan muddatlarda</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:3%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">26.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:30%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">2025-2026-yillarda qo‘shimcha 30 ta tuman (shahar)ni jadal kompleks rivojlantirish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:37%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">1. Hududlarni o‘rgangan holda 30 ta tuman (shahar) ro‘yxatini shakllantirish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">2. Shakllantirilgan ro‘yxat asosida </span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">30 ta tuman (shahar)ni 2025-2026-yillarga mo‘ljallangan jadal kompleks rivojlantirish dasturini tasdiqlash.</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">3. Tasdiqlangan dastur doirasida ishlarni manzilli olib borish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:12%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">2025-yil 1-iyul</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:16%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Vazirlar Mahkamasi,</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Iqtisodiyot va moliya vazirligi</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">(A. Xaydarov),</span></span></i></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">tegishli vazirlik va idoralar</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:100%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">VII. Zamonaviy axborot texnologiyalaridan foydalanish, mahallani muntazam internet aloqasi bilan ta’minlash</span></span></b></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:3%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">27.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:30%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Kambag‘allikni qisqartirish bo‘yicha raqamli texnologiyalarni rivojlantirish sohasida zarur chora-tadbirlar dasturini amalga oshirish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:37%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">1. Kambag‘allikni qisqartirish bo‘yicha raqamli texnologiyalarni rivojlantirish sohasida amalga oshiriladigan chora-tadbirlar dasturini tasdiqlash.</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Dasturda mahallani muntazam internet aloqasi bilan ta’minlash, har bir kambag‘al oilaga imtiyozli tarzda noutbuk olib berish, kambag‘al oilalarning a’zolarining axborot texnologiyalari va dasturlash bo‘yicha o‘quv kurslarida o‘qishi uchun sharoit yaratish, shu jumladan, maktablarda to‘garaklar tashkil etishni nazarda tutish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">2. Tasdiqlangan dastur doirasida ishlarni sifatli tashkil etish va doimiy monitoring o‘rnatib borish choralarini ko‘rish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:12%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">2024-yil 1-noyabr</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:16%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Raqamli texnologiyalar vazirligi</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">(Sh. Shermatov)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Maktabgacha va maktab ta’lim vazirligi</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">(X. Umarova)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Iqtisodiyot va moliya vazirligi</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">(I. Norqulov)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:3%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">28.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:30%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Internet tarmoqlari sifatini oshirish, maktablar bilan birga kambag‘al oila a’zolari uchun axborot texnologiyalari to‘garaklarini tashkil etishda yuzaga kelgan muammolarni hal etishga ko‘maklashish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:37%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">1. Internet tarmoqlari holatini manzilli o‘rganish va internet bilan bog‘liq muammolar mavjud bo‘lgan mahallalar ro‘yxatini shakllantirish va Raqamli texnologiyalar vazirligiga taqdim etish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">2. Kambag‘al oilalar farzandlari uchun axborot texnologiyalari to‘garaklarini tashkil etish va aniqlangan muammolarni mas’ullar tomonidan joylarda hal etishga ko‘maklashish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:12%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Doimiy</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:16%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Mahallalarga biriktirilgan respublika darajasidagi davlat idoralarining rahbar xodimlari</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:3%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">29.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:30%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Yoshlarning tafakkurini kengaytirishga, xorijiy tillarni va matn, jadval hamda grafiklarni tayyorlash va tahrirlash dasturlarini (microsoft office va shu kabi boshqalar), dasturlash ko‘nikmalarini o‘rganishga asoslangan o‘quv kurslar majmuini ishlab chiqish hamda har bir noutbuklarga o‘rnatish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:37%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">1. Dasturlash ko‘nikmalarini o‘rganishga asoslangan o‘quv kurslar majmuini ishlab chiqish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">2. </span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Kambag‘al oila a’zolarining farzandlariga beriladigan noutbuklarga zaruriy ishlash dasturlarini o‘rnatish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">3. Dasturlar bilan ishlash bo‘yicha qo‘llanmalarni noutbukka joylashtirish va ulardan foydalanish bo‘yicha zaruriy ko‘nikmalarni berish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:12%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">2024-yil 1-noyabr</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:16%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Raqamli texnologiyalar vazirligi</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">(Sh. Shermatov)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Yoshlar ishlar agentligi</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">(A. Sa’dullayev)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Maktabgacha va maktab ta’lim vazirligi</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">(X. Umarova)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:3%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center; text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">30.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:30%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Yoshlarga tafakkurini kengaytirish, xorijiy tillarni va dasturlash asoslarini o‘rganishga qaratilgan masofaviy o‘quv kurslarida bepul o‘qish imkoniyatini yaratish hamda undan erkin foydalanishni ta’minlash.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:37%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">1. Masofaviy o‘quv kurslarida bepul o‘qish tartibini ishlab chiqish va tasdiqlash.</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">2. Yoshlarning tafakkurini kengaytirish, xorijiy tillarni va dasturlash asoslarini o‘rganish bo‘yicha yillik buyurtmalarni ishlab chiqish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:9.65pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">3. </span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Masofaviy o‘quv kurslarini tashkillashtirish hamda monitoring ishlarini olib borish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
